	"tasks": [
		{
			"uuid": "d5df15ac-40f7-40a5-8feb-55d752fafbb5",
			"title": "Character Stats",
			"description": "\nSpeed\nHP\n\nSTR\t - mods Physical Damage\nDEX - mods Speed and Ranged and Dex Damage\nINT\t - mods Magical Damage\nCON - mods HP\nWIS\t - mods status resistance\n\nLevel\nXP (only player, allows them to progress lvl. enemies live with the lvl they spawned in)\n\nValue of stats is calculated when used.\nEx: Max Health calculation (baseHP + (CON * 4)) is recalculated every time stats can change (equipment change, stat buffs/debuffs)\nEx: Damage (baseDmg + (STR * weaponSTRmod)) is recalculated every hit",
			"category": "114073a4-1e9a-4023-bf3c-69a71193098e",
			"steps": []
		},
