		{
			"uuid": "73d2c789-8b03-4250-bea9-c3830459548b",
			"title": "MAIN CONCEPT",
			"description": "You are part of the crew of a derelict starship locked in orbit over a mysterious planet\nYou must explore this planets ruins in order to collect artifacts that keep away creatures and energies trying to destroy the ship\n\nGet launched in a pod into a dungeon. Once exited, the pod keeps drilling further down, you will find it again when you reach the end of the dungeon \n\nYou use modern gear:\n(Guns, suits, consumables)\nThat you can purchase and upgrade in the ship\n\nYou use dungeon gear:\n(Weapons, jewelry, consumables)\nThat you find in the dungeon",
			"category": "33cae5c0-924f-469b-8ae0-fc57a5e7b440",
			"steps": []
		},
