		{
			"uuid": "c52ce17b-65e5-41c6-a482-0deb9a8f7526",
			"title": "3D Player",
			"description": "\nSelect species when starting run\nspecies can change ingame\ncolor customization??\n\n\nEquipables show in model\nweapon animations",
			"category": "a1886d67-74d1-4025-9877-4525aba4402a",
			"steps": []
		},
		{
			"uuid": "033c5afc-3a7a-4774-a24a-23395fb68aa1",
			"title": "SPECIES",
			"description": "\nSpecies: (all sum to +10)\n\nHuman\t\t(Str:+2, Dex: +2, Int:+2, Wis:+2, Con:+2)\t=>\t\nDrake\t\t\t(Str:+2, Dex: +2, Int:+1, Wis:+4, Con:+1)\t=>\tDraconic Ascension: Absorb enemy souls to charge a temporary power up\nAvian\t\t\t(Str:+0, Dex: +4, Int:+2, Wis:+3, Con:+1)\t=>\tWind gust: Push yourself backwards and enemies away\nBovine\t\t(Str:+4, Dex: +0, Int:+0, Wis:+2, Con:+4)\t=>\tHeavy burl: Knock enemies up (area stun)\nLupine\t\t(Str:+2, Dex: +1, Int:+1, Wis:+4, Con:+1)\t=> \t\nViper\t\t\t(Str:+0, Dex: +3, Int:+4, Wis:+2, Con:+1)\t=>\tHypnotic Gaze: Confuse / turn enemies\nSynth\t\t\t\n\nSPECIES IDEAS\n\n==== Drake ====\nStats:\n\t(Str: 5, Dex: 3, Int: 3, Wis: 4, Con: 5)\n\nAbility:\n\t> Re-evolve into a corrupt version of the ancestors, growing in size and stats, improve secondary weapon\n\nPassive:\n\t> Chemical resistance?\nDesc:\n\t- De-evolved from large flying beasts, %SPECIES% have lost their large size and ability to fly after millenia living underground, aftermath of a global chemical war that left their natal world's atmosphere unbreathable and it's surface inhospitable. %SPECIES% now use their long back appendages as crude weapons, remnants of their long ancestor's luscious wings.\n\n==== HUMAN  ====",
			"category": "33cae5c0-924f-469b-8ae0-fc57a5e7b440",
			"steps": []
		},
		{
			"uuid": "f63fc33d-d92d-4087-beae-5066bca0bd87",
			"title": "Chest with loot generated from pools",
